homelab-borg-service-backup-server (0.1.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release, split out of the former combined
    homelab-borg-service-backup package. Creates the borgbackup system
    user/group and backup directory (default /var/borgbackup), and
    provides enroll/list/revoke/admin-recovery-key so clients never need
    SSH or sudo access to this server to onboard.

 -- Gardner <gardner@homelab>  Sun, 16 Aug 2026 23:00:00 -0500
